 da: angular width (degrees), \n#      v: median velocity (km/s)\n#     dv: variation (1 sigma) of velocity over the width of the CME\n#   minv: lowest velocity detected within the CME\n#   maxv: highest velocity detected within the CME\n#  halo?: II if da>90, III if da>180, IV if da>270, indicating potential halo/partial halo CME\n# \n  </PRE>\n <td valign='top'>\n  <PRE>\n# CME |          t0    | dt0| pa | da |  v  |  dv | minv| maxv| halo?\n  <a href=\"CME0018/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0018</a>|2026/08/20 20:00| 01 | 188| 010| 1924| 0168| 1562| 1953|    \n  <a href=\"CME0017/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0017</a>|2026/08/20 19:48| 02 | 055| 168| 1646| 0190| 1302| 2020|  II\n  <a href=\"CME0016/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0016</a>|2026/08/20 18:48| 04 | 253| 088| 1248| 0071| 1158| 1420|    \n  <a href=\"CME0015/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0015</a>|2026/08/20 13:36| 01 | 133| 016| 1746| 0396| 0960| 1953|    \n  <a href=\"CME0014/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0014</a>|2026/08/20 13:36| 03 | 253| 172| 1646| 0355| 0726| 1953|  II\n  <a href=\"CME0013/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0013</a>|2026/08/20 11:48| 03 | 057| 132| 063"
